@page
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TicTacToe SignalR Server</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
            color: #fff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 24px;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 48px 40px;
            max-width: 520px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            opacity: 0.9;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .status {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
            border: 2px solid #22c55e;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .info {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .endpoint {
            font-family: monospace;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: #fde68a;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        .note {
            margin-top: 24px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            opacity: 0.85;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h1>TicTacToe Server</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Servidor SignalR – Tres en Raya</p>
        <div class="status">
            ✔ Server running
        </div>
        <div class="info">
            <p>Este servidor no tiene interfaz gráfica.</p>
            <p>Conéctate desde la aplicación cliente.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="endpoint">
            SignalR Hub: /gameHub
        </div>
        <div class="note">
            <p>Abre la app en dos dispositivos o pestañas para jugar.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
